<section class="why-work-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Why Work Here</h2>
      <p>
        At Avonce, we don't just build projects - we build careers. Our teams
        deliver complex multifamily and commercial construction through
        integrated scopes, precise coordination, and pride in craftsmanship. We
        value field leadership, accountability, and a hands-on approach that
        supports professional growth at every level.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-work-section {
    width: 100%;
    height: 484px;
    background: #303030;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 150px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 100px;
  }

  .content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 33px;
    max-width: 884px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif !important;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 130%;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #fcfcfc;
    margin: 0;
  }

  p {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 170%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fcfcfc;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .why-work-section {
      height: auto;
      padding: 80px 0;
    }
    .container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
